# LAN Chat Privacy Policy

This extension does NOT collect, store, or transmit any data to the
author or any third-party server.

All chat content, files, avatars, nicknames and passwords entered by
users are sent ONLY to the self-hosted LAN Chat server whose URL the
user manually enters in the extension. The author of this extension
has no access to that server or its data.

Locally, the extension uses chrome.storage.local to remember the
server URL and nickname for convenience. No analytics, tracking, or
external data transmission is performed by the extension itself.

